&lt;h1&gt;&lt;span&gt;OVERSEERER COMMAND DELIBERATION&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;span&gt;Office of the O5 Council&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;hr /&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span&gt;Related project&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Extra-Universal Hume Control Applications in the mitigation of Mass anomalous activity.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
