comma splices and run-on sentences! Margssentif is just asking to be banned at this point.</p> <div class="collapsible-block"> <div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">Show&nbsp;cursed&nbsp;writing</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none"> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">Dear&nbsp;God&nbsp;my&nbsp;eyes</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-content"></div> </div> </div> </div> <div id="wiki-tab-0-2" style="display:none"> <p>Margssentif somehow managed to get other users to make things for him. Doubtlessly they did it out of fear of his <span style="text-decoration: line-through;">colossal muscles and beautiful features</span> or hope that he’d leave them alone for a few minutes.</p> <p><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/calibri-bold" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=5045819&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609837196" alt="Calibri Bold" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=5045819)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/calibri-bold" >Calibri Bold</a></span> <a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=aTLYHy3Aqqw&amp;t=3s%20reads%20Margssentif%E2%80%99s%20SCP-5086.%20Cover%20your%20eyes,%20ears,%20and%20nose%20so%20none%20of%20the%20incredibly%20mundane%20writing%20gets%20in.">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=aTLYHy3Aqqw&amp;t=3s reads Margssentif’s SCP-5086. Cover your eyes, ears, and nose so none of the incredibly mundane writing gets in.</a></p> <hr /> <div class="image-container aligncenter"><a href="http://scp-wiki.wdfiles.com/local--files/petition-to-ban-margssentif/Arorangi.jpg"><img src="http://scp-wiki.wdfiles.com/local--resized-images/petition-to-ban-margssentif/Arorangi.jpg/medium.jpg" alt="Arorangi.jpg" class="image" /></a></div> <p><sup><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/alces-alces" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=4057128&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609837196" alt="Alces_alces" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=4057128)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/alces-alces" >Alces_alces</a></span> had to be forced to make this art for Margssentif during the 2020 Holiday exchange because of course, no one would do that willingly</sup></p> </div> </div> </div> <br /> <div class="licensebox"> <div class="collapsible-block"> <div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">‡&nbsp;Licensing&nbsp;/&nbsp;Citation</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none"> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">‡&nbsp;Hide&nbsp;Licensing&nbsp;/&nbsp;Citation</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-content"> <p>Cite this page as:</p> <p>For more information, see <a href="http://www.scp-wiki.net/licensing-guide">Licensing Guide</a>.<br /> <strong>Licensing Disclosures</strong></p> <div class="content-separator" style="display: none:"></div> <p><strong>Image 1</strong></p> <blockquote> <p><strong>Filename:</strong> Arorangi.jpg<br /> <strong>Name:</strong> N/A<br /> <strong>Author:</strong> <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/alces-alces" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=4057128&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609837196" alt="Alces_alces" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=4057128)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/alces-alces" >Alces_alces</a></span><br /> <strong>License:</strong> CC BY-SA 3.0<br /> <strong>Source Link:</strong> <a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/local--files/petition-to-ban-margssentif/Arorangi.jpg">The SCP Wiki</a></p> </blockquote> <div class="content-separator" style="display: none:"></div> <div class="content-separator" style="display: none:"></div> <p>For more information about on-wiki content, visit the <a href="http://www.scp-wiki.net/licensing-master-list">Licensing Master List</a>.</p> </div> </div> </div> </div> <p>by <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/margssentif" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=3861605&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609837196" alt="margssentif" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=3861605)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/margssentif" >margssentif</a></span></p> 
